WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Zhang Tao was bitten to death by a faceless monster

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,920
And this state is obviously torn apart

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,880
That is to say

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:14,540
Huang Mao, let’s talk about Brother Huang again

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,080
Can I come with you?

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,720
Look, I've become like this

7
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,000
I will never cause destruction

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,280
Don't think too much about it

9
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:26,560
Brother Lin Yang doesn’t like you, a gangster, right?

10
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:32,810
Follow me and don't run around. Thank you, brother.

11
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:39,690
Just a word from you

12
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:40,690
Let's rush forward

13
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:42,820
Fatty saved me

14
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:48,560
I can't just die without saving Brother Lin.

15
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:11,990
Chen Yuyao

16
00:01:11,990 --> 00:01:13,470
He is also a human being

17
00:01:13,470 --> 00:01:14,670
They started fighting
